<title>USA: Winnebago completes Cycle-Sat sale.</title>
<headline>Winnebago completes Cycle-Sat sale.</headline>
<dateline>FOREST CITY, Iowa 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winnebago Industries Inc said Tuesday it completed the sale of its Cycle-Sat Inc subsidiary to Vyvx Inc, a unit of Williams Cos Inc of Tulsa, for about $57 million.</p>
<p>Cycle-Sat is a telecommunications service company and distributor of television and radio commercials using satellite, fiber-optic and digital technologies. It has about 220 employees.</p>
<p>Vyvx provides integrated satellite and fiber-optic video transmission services. Winnebago makes motor homes and components used by other manufacturers.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
